"When transferred to or from user memory via KVM_GET_ONE_REG or "
"KVM_SET_ONE_REG, the value of this register is of type "
"__u64[KVM_ARM64_SVE_VLS_WORDS], and encodes the set of vector lengths as "
"follows::"
